<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>GrandRP 2560 x 1440 WQHD</Major>
    <Description>This macro saves you the tedious task of constantly placing your goods in the beach market in GrandRP by hand. This macro fills all 30 slots from the backpack into the market with the price that you previously saved in your clipboard. You can also set a specific price in the macro instead of the control and V if an item or more should have a different price. You can also simply delete the slots from the macro that are not to be completed.

This macro should also work with the black market.

The macro starts in the backpack in the top left slot and continues to the right, when the row is finished, it jumps to the next row. You need a backpack LVL 3 or 4 for this macro to work

Can only be used in 2560 x 1440 WQHD resolution.

I'll publish more macros for the beach market soon</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
